SYNTHESIS: WHAT THIS SESSION ADVANCES
  strengthened:
    PGF root confinement is not just a scalar p0 restatement: consec_8 has 0 real roots, nearest |z|=1.489, while break_8 has 2 real roots, nearest |z|=0.121.
    The Lee-Yang signal should be paired with component/ear data: root collision rows
    also change the state-transition and q0-component sidecars, which HYP-3107 needs.
    Bravais rank says the named packets occupy a full 6-dimensional q-lattice face;
    a proof cannot reduce them to one moment without declaring lost coordinates.
  bold but still speculative:
    The phi4 lambda coefficient may be an extremality curvature coordinate.
    Ear-excess in the cell-state graph may be the observer-gluing sidecar that
    replaces raw H=7/H=21 analogies for LRC packets.
    Savitch midpoint certificates suggest a finite recursive proof-state search,
    but the hard theorem is still the coverage/observer certificate at the midpoint.
  rejected simplification:
    Raw scalar p0 and raw tournament H are too lossy.  They destroy the root stratum,
    first-live order, component count, and sidecar needed by the Lean frontier.

DONE.
